# Inline imports in test specs

Named imports must stay on one line. Do not wrap `{ ... }` across multiple lines.

```typescript
// ✅
import { authTest as test, expect } from '../test-base';
import { createPromotion, deletePromotion, getPromotionId } from '@helpers/api/promotion';

// ❌
import {
  createPromotion,
  deletePromotion,
  getPromotionId,
} from '@helpers/api/promotion';
```

Also enforced in `.agents/rules/code-style.md` → **Imports**.
